  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">曾經厭倦每次使用指令時都要重新打字嗎？那些日子已經結束了！現在您只需設定想要綁定的指令及對應的按鍵，就能透過按下按鍵立即使用它們。最棒的是什麼？這個模組僅限用戶端！這意味著伺服器端不需要安裝就能運作，而且您可以連接到任何伺服器時使用。<br><br>使用方法：<br>1. 前往設定GUI並設定想要綁定的指令（僅能從主選單的模組選單進行，不能在遊戲中進行）<br>2. 前往控制設定並將指令綁定到您想要的按鍵。如果新指令沒有出現，請重新啟動遊戲。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>聯絡方式</h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您要回報錯誤或崩潰問題，請<strong>使用<a href=\"https://github.com/The-Fireplace-Minecraft-Mods/Command-Keybindings/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a></strong>。對於功能請求，我也建議使用問題追蹤器，這樣其他人可以輕鬆看到已請求的內容，更重要的是，這能更容易追蹤已被請求的功能。話雖如此，如果您對模組有疑問，或想在發布前詢問功能請求，歡迎透過<a href=\"https://discord.gg/CJ6pNEk\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>或<a href=\"https://twitter.com/The_FireplaceMC\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>與我聯繫。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>查看我的其他模組：</h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>伺服器端模組：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/clans\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clans</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/grand-exchange\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grand Exchange</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/grand-economy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grand Economy</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/turtle-shell-drop\" rel=\"nofollow\">Turtle Shell Drop</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fires-survival-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fire's Survival Tweaks</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/mob-rebirth\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mob Rebirth</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/wg-block-replacer\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldGen Block Replacer</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/unforgiving-void\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unforgiving Void</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/fires-clay-spawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fire's Clay Spawn</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/raining-cats-and-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raining Cats and Dogs</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/rabbits-breed-like-rabbits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rabbits Breed Like Rabbits</a></p>\n<p><strong>用戶端模組：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/time-hud\" rel=\"nofollow\">Time HUD</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/command-keybindings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Command Keybindings</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hacker-voice-im-in-hvii\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hacker Voice: I'm In (HVII)</a></p>\n<p><strong>其他模組：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/overlord\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overlord</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/mechanical-soldiers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mechanical Soldiers</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/fires-random-things\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fire's Random Things</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/adobe-blocks-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Adobe Blocks 2</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/nether-essence\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Essence</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/nabb\" rel=\"nofollow\">New Age Bee Breeding (NABB)</a></p>\n</div><h2>&nbsp;</h2>",
